ce understanding as well as these records; the last execution is not the default next task.\",\n    \"execution_capacity\": {\n      \"available\": true,\n      \"timeout_ceiling_seconds\": 1200.0,\n      \"note\": \"Capacity is not a runtime estimate. Include construction/review time; source work remains useful if a test will not fit.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"citation_scope\": \"Result citations locate current and historical uses; an absent citation is not a task to clear. One applicable receipt can support multiple questions without a dedicated execution for each.\",\n  \"current\": {},\n  \"validation\": {\n    \"command\": [\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python\",\n      \"-I\",\n      \"-B\",\n      \"-c\",\n      \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\",\n      \"validate\",\n      \"--run\",\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-15_19-20-29-omnipaxos-real-run\",\n      \"--submission\"\n    ],\n    \"read_only_paths\": [\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src\",\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/lib/python3.10/site-packages\",\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin\",\n      \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/pyvenv.cfg\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"agent\": \"codex-cli 0.162.0-alpha.17.2\",\n    \"implementation\": \"rustc 1.94.1 (e408947bf 2026-03-25)\\nbinary: rustc\\ncommit-hash: e408947bfd200af42db322daf0fadfe7e26d3bd1\\ncommit-date: 2026-03-25\\nhost: x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\\nrelease: 1.94.1\\nLLVM version: 21.1.8\"\n  },\n  \"build_inputs\": [\n    {\n      \"record\": \"build-inputs/targets/omnipaxos/assurance_generated/basis.json\",\n      \"manifest\": \"omnipaxos/Cargo.toml\",\n      \"test_target\": \"assurance_generated\",\n      \"resolved_features\": [\n        \"async_runtime\",\n        \"default\",\n        \"l